&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is a leading creative company that combines brand experience, customer experience, and commerce, creating connected brands&amp;nbsp;to drive growth. VML is celebrated for its innovative and award-winning human-first work for clients including AstraZeneca, Colgate-Palmolive, Dell, Ford, Microsoft, Nestlé, The Coca-Cola Company, and Wendy&#39;s. In 2026, VML was named&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;Campaign’s&lt;/em&gt; Global Network of the Year and ranked #2 Creative Network of the Year at Cannes Lions. VML’s global network spans 55+ markets with principal offices in Buenos Aires, Kansas City, London, New York, São Paulo, Shanghai and Singapore.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VML is part of &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more information, please visit&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;ms-outlook-linkify&quot; href=&quot;http://www.vml.com/&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;fbec6e7f-765e-41de-af7b-a3ef743f9886&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;www.vml.com&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;u&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/u&gt;and follow along on  &lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.proofpoint.com/v2/url?u=https-3A__urldefense.com_v3_-5F-5Fhttps-3A_www.linkedin.com_company_vml_-5F-5F-3B-21-21JboVxjCXSME-21OhlpCfbkl1UcWPwns1-2DGtvHOzFh0QwHV49fsPgGw-2DVCCU1bCg8aQFI9vN-2Dy-2DVwaQcITH2j2XKzGKBIFRLYf2AUWVYY1dFGK6-24&amp;amp;d=DwMFaQ&amp;amp;c=euGZstcaTDllvimEN8b7jXrwqOf-v5A_CdpgnVfiiMM&amp;amp;r=zouFnm4jZMgDFaYF1uVcRY3rbgHWPca_luUrBUkT6Yc&amp;amp;m=QzcCgXCAOjzj5hiU48_CKOdHRSJ4_YpuqfviT9yjlzH5VrkzySTZ-WaQXlYAnj4W&amp;amp;s=jJ7q5V70u9oUx7ONPm5jC3IK8y6vxDilX6BGTlqlWlA&amp;amp;e=&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;b89e4621-22a7-4a88-a5da-c6ecc3a722be&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;#WeAreVML.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Lead Product Manager needed to own the product strategy, discovery, delivery and adoption of on of our key clients digital transformations.&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;The opportunity&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and commercially minded&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Lead Product Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to drive product strategy, discovery, design, delivery and adoption for&amp;nbsp;one of our key retail clients’ Ecommerce transformation programmes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Lead Product Manager, you will be working within the client’s Product team with accountability for translating business and customer needs into a clear product strategy and measurable outcomes. You will lead cross-functional teams through discovery, design, development, launch and continuous improvement, while building alignment across senior stakeholders, programme and delivery teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic leadership role, not solely a backlog-management position. You will be embedded within the client’s Product team, alongside agency colleagues and client staff. We are looking for someone who can operate confidently from product vision and commercial strategy through to detailed execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the product Vision:&amp;nbsp;Define, communicate, and drive the product strategy and roadmap for your product scope, ensuring alignment with programme direction and wider business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Delivery:&amp;nbsp;Lead multidisciplinary squads across Product, UX/UI, Delivery and Optimisation, making pragmatic trade-offs to balance rapid delivery with long-term objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Customer-Centric Discovery:&amp;nbsp;Champion user research, journey mapping, and problem validation, ensuring that every platform feature solves genuine customer problems and enhances the digital shopping experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stakeholder Alignment &amp;amp; Strategy:&amp;nbsp;Act as a strategic product voice for senior executives and business leaders, translating complex technical and commercial trade-offs into clear, actionable roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion Modern Product Practices:&amp;nbsp;Embed Agile, Lean, and continuous discovery methodologies into the team’s DNA, fostering a culture of high performance, accountability, and customer empathy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Measurable Commercial Value: Focus relentlessly on strategic outcomes, connecting product decisions directly to revenue growth, operational efficiency, and customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we want from you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;E-commerce &amp;amp; Digital Transformation Expertise:&amp;nbsp;Extensive experience as a Lead/Senior Product Manager within Retail e-commerce, with a proven track record of driving large-scale digital transformation projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform migration:&amp;nbsp;Demonstrable experience in managing the complex transition from legacy systems to modern architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&amp;nbsp;A deep understanding of how to seamlessly integrate Engineering and UX/UI disciplines, motivating teams without necessarily having direct line-management authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic &amp;amp; Commercial Acumen:&amp;nbsp;The ability to pivot effortlessly between high-level commercial strategy and detailed technical execution, making confident decisions in complex, ambiguous enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile Mastery:&amp;nbsp;Strong practical knowledge of modern product management frameworks (Scrum, Kanban, outcome-based planning) and proficiency with tools like Jira and Confluence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Omnichannel Retail Insight:&amp;nbsp;A strong grasp of the modern retail ecosystem, understanding how a cutting-edge online customer experience integrates with wider physical and digital touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You: Self-starter, decisive, able to deal with ambiguity and to influence wider stakeholders within a large programme of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;If you have some of this, even better&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A recognised Product Management or Agile Product Owner certification is desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we can offer you&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Alongside the opportunity to work with some of the most exciting brands around the world, we’ll also prioritise your career development and help you grow your skills. We’ll empower you to make a difference, allow you to be yourself, and respect who you are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our culture thrives on our core values, designed for impact-driven individuals: Heart, Brains and Courage.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We lead with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Heart&lt;/strong&gt;, fostering empathy and trust where genuine connections and human-centric work flourish.&lt;br&gt;We empower your&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Brains&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for innovation, valuing relentless curiosity and collaborative intelligence to solve complex challenges.&lt;br&gt;And we champion&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Courage&lt;/strong&gt;, inspiring you to speak up, embrace experimentation, and advocate for bold solutions that push our thinking to be better than yesterday.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;How we use AI in the recruitment process:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;LineBreakBlob BlobObject DragDrop SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;To ensure more focused and engaging conversations, we&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;leverage&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;AI in our recruitment process exclusively for secure, objective&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;note-taking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;, never for evaluative judgments. This allows our team to be fully present with you. You are always welcome to request a transcript of these notes or opt out of this feature at any time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Opting out will not&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun ContextualSpellingAndGrammarErrorV2Themed SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;impact&amp;nbsp; the&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;outcome of the interview process&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot;&gt;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW109799401 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP Enterprise Solutions is part of&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http:/wpp.com/__;!!IfJP2Nwhk5Z0yJ43lA!L_cfT4E3gsmmDY1lVQTB6ihlfPeBl9X4sMM2KI6iWZYexC2nCeZ9oxgP9qvgbrqxIBpx82rGb_mWqh5F0zKxq5_dP7Y$&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;WPP&lt;/a&gt;, the trusted growth partner for the world&#39;s leading brands. Powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform WPP Open, WPP unites cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, creativity, production, enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office an average of four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;WPP (VML) is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;scxw176048299&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-GB&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When you click &quot;Submit Application&quot;, this will send any information you add below to VML. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/recruitment-privacy-policy&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy&lt;/a&gt;. California residents should read our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.vml.com/california-recruitment-privacy-notice&quot;&gt;California Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;. This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Strength in Trust&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;OneTrust’s mission is to enable innovation through the responsible use of data and AI. We believe that ensuring data is trusted shouldn’t slow teams down—it should accelerate what’s possible. This led us to develop the first technology platform for responsible data use in 2016. Today, with AI representing the latest and most impactful expansion of data yet, OneTrust is once again redefining what responsible innovation looks like. OneTrust, the AI‑Ready Governance Platform™, unifies regulatory intelligence, automation, and connected governance workflows so businesses can continue to move at the speed of AI while ensuring good governance to prevent data misuse at scale. Trusted by thousands of organizations worldwide, OneTrust is shaping the future where trusted data becomes a transformative force for business and society.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Challenge&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Technical Architect (Privacy) to join our Technical Advisory team (part of Customer Success). This is a customer-facing role for someone who combines a strong technical foundation with attention to details, and the ability to build trust with customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with privacy, legal, compliance, and technology stakeholders to understand business objectives and challenges, assess maturity and platform adoption, and provide clear recommendations across privacy processes, operating models, workflows, data, and integrations. You will act as a trusted advisor and product expert without owning hands-on implementation or configuration.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous privacy or OneTrust expertise is valuable, but it is not the defining requirement for this role. We are looking for someone with the attitude, consultancy skills, and technical capability to learn the privacy domain quickly and become a trusted advisor.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead outcome-focused discovery, advisory engagements, workshops, and expert sessions with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clarify customer objectives, constraints, stakeholders, and desired outcomes before recommending a path forward.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business and regulatory needs into practical recommendations for privacy processes, workflows, data, integrations, and OneTrust capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explain solution options, dependencies, trade-offs, and implications for scale at the appropriate level of detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess customer readiness, adoption barriers, process maturity, and solution direction; recommend pragmatic next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear, decision-ready deliverables such as current-state assessments, future-state recommendations, reference architectures, process guidance, and reusable patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships and communicate confidently with both technical and executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Customer Success, Product, Sales, Support, Professional Services, and other specialist teams to deliver consistent customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture recurring customer needs and translate them into feedback, enablement content, playbooks, and product opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear advisory boundaries: provide strategic framing, product expertise, and guidance while enabling customers or delivery partners to execute implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Experience Includes:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in consulting, technical advisory, solution consulting, customer success, business analysis, transformation, or another customer-facing problem-solving role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong technical background in enterprise software (ideally SaaS), systems, data, workflow design, integrations, APIs, solution architecture, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative approach: you listen carefully, ask effective questions, structure ambiguity, and turn complex problems into clear recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong learning agility and a constructive attitude, including curiosity, ownership, humility, resilience, and openness to feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to connect customer objectives to practical technology and operating-model decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to adapt the message for executive, functional, and technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independent but also a team player&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience influencing stakeholders and collaborating across functions without direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS in a related subject is required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Extra Impressive:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in privacy, data protection, privacy operations, privacy technology, or a closely related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with OneTrust Privacy Automation or comparable privacy-management platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with privacy regulations and frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;OneTrust certifications or relevant privacy credentials such as CIPP/E, CIPM, CIPT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience advising enterprise customers on adoption, optimization, governance, or value realization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience creating reusable advisory playbooks, reference architectures, or enablement materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using software for reporting and task management, such as Salesforce&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Where we Work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are embracing an office-first culture, encouraging three days a week in office for most roles, with meaningful opportunities to collaborate and celebrate in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each role may have specific requirements or flexibility depending on the scope of the position, so we encourage you to verify this with your recruiter during your first interview.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;Benefits&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;As an employee at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTrust&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;, you will be part of the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2Themed SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;OneTeam&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;. That means &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW202854797 BCX0&quot;&gt; receive support physically, mentally, and emotionally so that you can do your best work both in and out of the office. This includes comprehensive healthcare coverage, flexible PTO, equity RSUs, annual performance bonus opportunities, retirement account support, 14+ weeks of paid parental leave, career development opportunities, company-paid privacy certification exam fees, and much more. Specific benefits differ by country. For more information, talk to your recruiter or visit onetrust.com/careers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Resources&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Check out the following to learn more about OneTrust and its people:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
