&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Financial rigour&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Builds robust P&amp;amp;L and scenario models independently. Understands how operational levers flow to unit economics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
